{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36565","headline":"经张舍人旧居 · 罗隐","name":"经张舍人旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行尘不是昔时尘，谩向朱门忆侍臣。\n一榻已无开眼处，九泉应有爱才人。\n文余吐凤他年诏，树想栖鸾旧日春。\n从此恩深转难报，夕阳衰草泪沾巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36565.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36565","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}